# dev_experiment folder

This folder contains exploratory checks that are run manually and are not part
of the regular unit-test or simulation-test suites.

The `mpi_mumps_reduction.py` and `mpi_mumps_threads.py` scripts were created
during reduced-rank MUMPS solver development. They exercise native MUMPS and MPI
behavior; the thread checks require eight ranks on one node and
`OMP_NUM_THREADS=2`. The `mpi_recipes_subcomm.py` script checks MPI vector
recipes and subcommunicators. These scripts require a working MPI environment
and the relevant Petra-M native dependencies.

Example commands from the Petra-M repository root:

```sh
PYTHONPATH=python OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 mpiexec -n 4 python test/dev_experiment/mpi_mumps_reduction.py
PYTHONPATH=python OMP_NUM_THREADS=2 mpiexec -n 8 python test/dev_experiment/mpi_mumps_threads.py
PYTHONPATH=python mpiexec -n 4 python test/dev_experiment/mpi_recipes_subcomm.py
```

The reduced-rank scripts predate the current opt-in `reduce_mpi_proc` GUI
setting. Their reduced-rank cases need updating before they can serve as
regression checks for the current interface.
